{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"RetryPolicy","kind":"identifier"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/PersistenceMiddlewareGuide"]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Retrying matters because the buffers are cleared at flush time: without it a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"failed save only ever reaches disk if the user happens to touch the same","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"entity again, which is silent data loss. Retrying ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"forever"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" matters just as","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"much in the other direction — a write that can never succeed (disk full, a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"model the container can’t encode, a schema mismatch) must not keep the stack","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"busy indefinitely. So attempts are bounded, and running out is an event the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"app can see rather than a silence.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux"]]},"abstract":[{"text":"How ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/PersistencePlugin"},{"text":" retries a flush whose save failed.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Structure","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"RetryPolicy"}],"modules":[{"name":"Swidux"}],"symbolKind":"struct","role":"symbol","title":"RetryPolicy","externalID":